  "description": "<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"357\">Starlink: Battle for Atlas is een actievolle <strong data-start=\"108\" data-end=\"132\">ruimte-avonturengame</strong> waarin je het heelal verkent, vijanden verslaat en missies voltooit in een open sterrenstelsel. De Starter Pack bevat het basisspel en fysieke schepen die je direct op je controller plaatst, waardoor het spel tot leven komt.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"503\">Uniek aan de Switch-versie is de exclusieve aanwezigheid van Fox McCloud uit Star Fox, wat deze editie extra bijzonder maakt voor Nintendo-fans.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"508\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"521\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"540\"><strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"540\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"562\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"594\">🚀 Open wereld in de ruimte</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"635\">\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"635\">🎮 Innovatieve toys-to-life gameplay</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"678\">\r\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"678\">🛸 Inclusief fysieke schepen en piloot</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"722\">\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"722\">⭐ Exclusieve Star Fox-content op Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"754\">🌌 Veel missies en upgrades</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"781\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<li data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"811\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"858\">\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"858\">Genre: Actie-avonturengame / space shooter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"882\">Spelers: 1–2 lokaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"917\">Taal: Meertalig (incl. Engels)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"939\">Uitgever: Ubisoft</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"964\">Editie: Starter Pack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"990\">\r\n<p data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"990\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"995\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1015\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1033\">Gamecartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1054\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1099\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1099\">Starlink Starter Pack (schepen & piloot)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1130\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1167\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1167\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
